// Public test world only (NODE_PUBLIC_TEST): the nine 0gp infinite-stock shops sold by the
// bank shop keepers (scripts/public_test/scripts/public_test.rs2, scripts/shop/scripts/shop.rs2).
// UNKNOWN: engineering test-world stock, not an authentic shop. Counts are display values only:
// public test purchases never deplete them and these shops never buy. The shops show the
// unnoted objs; bulk supplies are handed over noted (public_test.enum).
// Excluded on purpose (content under test): Infinity, Mage Training Arena rewards, Fire cape,
// TzHaar/Obsidian, Onyx, Barrows, Castle Wars and Pest Control items.

